---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="StarterGuide herunterladen | PraxisMaik"
  description="Lade den kostenlosen PraxisMaik StarterGuide mit den 10 häufigsten Fehlern im Praxisbesuch herunter."
>
  <section class="download-page">
    <div class="download-page__card">
      <div class="download-page__icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>

      <p class="download-page__eyebrow">Deine Anmeldung war erfolgreich</p>

      <h1>Dein StarterGuide ist bereit</h1>

      <p class="download-page__intro">
        Vielen Dank für deine Anmeldung. Du kannst den kostenlosen StarterGuide
        <strong>„Die 10 häufigsten Fehler im Praxisbesuch“</strong>
        jetzt als PDF herunterladen.
      </p>

      <div class="download-page__guide">
        <img
          src="/images/starterguide-cover.png"
          alt="Cover des PraxisMaik StarterGuides: Die 10 häufigsten Fehler im Praxisbesuch"
          width="720"
          height="1018"
          loading="eager"
        />

        <div class="download-page__guide-content">
          <h2>Das erwartet dich</h2>

          <ul>
            <li>35 Seiten praxisnahes Wissen</li>
            <li>10 typische Fehler im Praxisbesuch</li>
            <li>Merksätze und konkrete Praxistipps</li>
            <li>Pflegerisch denken statt auswendig lernen</li>
          </ul>

          <a
            class="download-page__download"
            href="/downloads/StarterGuide-10-haeufigsten-Fehler-im-Praxisbesuch.pdf"
            download
            data-ga-event="file_download"
          >
            StarterGuide als PDF herunterladen
          </a>

          <p class="download-page__note">
            Die PDF-Datei öffnet sich direkt oder wird auf deinem Gerät gespeichert.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="download-page__premium" aria-labelledby="premium-title">
      <p class="download-page__premium-eyebrow">
        Du möchtest noch sicherer werden?
      </p>

      <h2 id="premium-title">
        Pflege verstehen, sicher entscheiden und fachlich begründen
      </h2>

      <p>
        Im Premiumbereich von PraxisMaik findest du alles, was dich während
        deiner Pflegeausbildung und bei deinen Praxisbesuchen unterstützt.
      </p>

      <div class="download-page__facts">
        <div>
          <strong>240+</strong>
          <span>Lernskripte</span>
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>45</strong>
          <span>Prüfungsfälle</span>
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>61</strong>
          <span>Examensfragen</span>
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>6</strong>
          <span>Premium-E-Books</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a
        class="download-page__premium-link"
        href="/premium/"
        data-ga-event="starterguide_download_premium_click"
      >
        Premium entdecken
      </a>

      <p class="download-page__price">
        39 € einmalig, kein Abo, dauerhafter Zugriff
      </p>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .download-page {
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem) 0 clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8rem);
  }

  .download-page__card {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    border: 1px solid #efddcc;
    border-radius: 1.75rem;
    background: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgb(80 52 31 / 10%);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .download-page__icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 4rem;
    height: 4rem;
    margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fff0e2;
    color: #e67e22;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .download-page__eyebrow,
  .download-page__premium-eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    color: #b9550d;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .downcolor: load-page h1 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #171717;
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.06;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .download-page__intro {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 1.35rem auto 0;
    color: #4f4f4f;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.17rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .download-page__guide {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, 330px) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .download-page__guide img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 1px solid #ead8c7;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgb(70 44 24 / 14%);
  }

  .download-page__guide-content h2 {
    margin: 0;
   color: #171717;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.35rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .download-page__guide-content ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .download-page__guide-content li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.9rem;
    color: #3f3f3f;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .download-page__guide-content li::before {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    color: #e67e22;
    content: "✓";
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .download-page__download,
  .download-page__premium-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 3.7rem;
    padding: 0.95rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.85rem;
    background: #e67e22;
    color: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgb(230 126 34 / 20%);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    line-height: 1.25;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      transform 160ms ease,
      background-color 160ms ease,
      box-shadow 160ms ease;
  }

  .download-page__download {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .download-page__download:hover,
  .download-page__premium-link:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    background: #d96f16;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 38px rgb(230 126 34 / 26%);
  }

  .download-page__download:focus-visible,
  .download-page__premium-link:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid rgb(230 126 34 / 35%);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .download-page__note {
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    color: #707070;
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .download-page__premium {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem) auto 0;
    padding: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    border: 1px solid #f0d8c1;
    border-radius: 1.75rem;
    background: #fff8f1;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .download-page__premium h2 {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: #171717;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .download-page__premium > p:not(.download-page__premium-eyebrow):not(.download-page__price) {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 1.3rem auto 0;
    color: #505050;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .download-page__facts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }

  .download-page__facts div {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid #efd8c2;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .download-page__facts strong {
    color: #e67e22;
    font-size: 1.65rem;
  }

  .download-page__facts span {
    color: #4f4f4f;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .download-page__premium-link {
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }

  .download-page__price {
    margin: 0.9rem 0 0;
    color: #686868;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .download-page__guide {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .download-page__guide img {
      width: min(78%, 330px);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .download-page__guide-content ul {
      width: fit-content;
      max-width: 100%;
      margin-inline: auto;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .download-page__facts {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 460px) {
    .download-page__facts {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .download-page__download,
    .download-page__premium-link {
      transition: none;
    }

    .download-page__download:hover,
    .download-page__premium-link:hover {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>